# TriggersWhenSpent$ (AbilityManaPart.java:333-339): Pyromancer's Goggles' {R}
# carries its trigger; spent on a red instant it registers a this-turn delayed
# SpellCast trigger for that spell, which copies it. The copy keeps its target
# (confirmeffect false), so ai takes 6.
startturn human
advance 3
queue targets ai
queue confirmeffect false
queue action human manaability 1 0
queue action human cast 2
passpriority
